{"work":"tipitaka","version":"sc-pli","book":"an1","chapter":235,"title":"18. Pañcamavagga","verses":[
{"v":"1","t":"“Etadaggaṁ, bhikkhave, mama sāvikānaṁ bhikkhunīnaṁ rattaññūnaṁ yadidaṁ mahāpajāpatigotamī."},
{"v":"2","t":"… Mahāpaññānaṁ yadidaṁ khemā."},
{"v":"3","t":"… Iddhimantīnaṁ yadidaṁ uppalavaṇṇā."},
{"v":"4","t":"… Vinayadharānaṁ yadidaṁ paṭācārā."},
{"v":"5","t":"… Dhammakathikānaṁ yadidaṁ dhammadinnā."},
{"v":"6","t":"… Jhāyīnaṁ yadidaṁ nandā."},
{"v":"7","t":"… Āraddhavīriyānaṁ yadidaṁ soṇā."},
{"v":"8","t":"… Dibbacakkhukānaṁ yadidaṁ bakulā."},
{"v":"9","t":"… Khippābhiññānaṁ yadidaṁ bhaddā kuṇḍalakesā."},
{"v":"10","t":"… Pubbenivāsaṁ anussarantīnaṁ yadidaṁ bhaddā kāpilānī."},
{"v":"11","t":"… Mahābhiññāpattānaṁ yadidaṁ bhaddakaccānā."},
{"v":"12","t":"… Lūkhacīvaradharānaṁ yadidaṁ kisāgotamī."},
{"v":"13","t":"… Saddhādhimuttānaṁ yadidaṁ siṅgālakamātā”ti. Vaggo pañcamo."}
]}
